    funnelStage: "mofu", ctaType: M, conceptBucket: "proven", effort: "high",
    bodyBlack: "Saying yes to the wrong client costs more than saying no ever does -- here's the exact filter I run before any new engagement.\nFilter 1: can we point to a specific past client we've helped with almost this exact problem? If not, we're experimenting on their dollar.\nFilter 2: is the timeline realistic for the complexity, or are they asking for a 3-month result in 3 weeks? Compressed timelines create resentment on both sides.\nFilter 3: do they have the internal authority to actually implement what we recommend, or will the work die in approval? No decision-maker in the room means no real engagement.\nAny one \"no\" and I turn it down, even when the fee is attractive -- a bad-fit client costs more in reputation and team time than the revenue is worth.\nComment \"FILTER\" and I'll send you the exact 3-question filter as a checklist.",
