    bodyBlack: "Episode 2: why chasing revenue without watching margin can grow you straight into a cash crisis.\nA client that pays more but costs disproportionately more to deliver for can be worse for the business than a smaller, more efficient one -- revenue alone hides that.\nThe framework: calculate true delivery cost per client type, including your own time at a real hourly rate, before deciding which segment to chase.\nSecond: once you know margin by segment, direct new-business effort toward the highest-margin segment first, even if it's not the biggest.\nComment \"MARGIN\" and I'll send you the delivery-cost calculator we use with clients.",
