    funnelStage: "mofu", ctaType: M, conceptBucket: "proven", effort: "high", seriesName: "Founder Finance 101",
    bodyBlack: "Episode 3: the specific mistake I've watched kill more growing businesses than slow growth ever does -- collections timing mismatch.\nIf you pay your team and vendors faster than clients pay you, growth speeds up the exact gap that eventually breaks you.\nThe framework: track your average days-to-collect against your average days-to-pay, monthly -- if collect is longer than pay, growth is actively working against your cash position.\nSecond: fix the gap with payment terms, not only hustle -- a 50% deposit upfront can close more of the gap than any amount of chasing invoices.\nComment \"COLLECT\" and I'll send you the payment-terms language that closed this gap for our clients.",
