    bodyBlack: "Sign 1: your close rate is above 70% at your current price -- you're leaving money on the table, not risking the deal.\nSign 2: clients tell you the work was worth more than they paid, unprompted.\nSign 3: you're turning away work because you're at capacity, not because it's a bad fit.\nComment \"RATES\" and I'll DM you how much I'd raise by and how I'd announce it.",
