    funnelStage: "bofu", ctaType: B, conceptBucket: "proven", effort: "high",
    bodyBlack: "Naive founder: \"I want a retainer so I have access to a consultant whenever I need it.\"\nInsider: \"Unlimited access without a defined scope is how retainers turn into scope creep on both sides -- fair to neither party.\"\nNaive founder: \"So how should it actually work?\"\nInsider: \"Cap it to a specific number of hours or deliverables per month, with a clear overflow rate defined upfront -- both sides know exactly where the line is.\"\nNaive founder: \"What about the outcomes, not only the hours?\"\nInsider: \"Pair the retainer with one quarterly outcome review -- hours pay for access, the review keeps everyone honest about whether it's actually working.\"\nComment \"RETAINER\" and I'll DM you the exact retainer structure we use with clients.",
