    funnelStage: "mofu", ctaType: M, conceptBucket: "proven", effort: "high", seriesName: "Consulting Insider",
    bodyBlack: "Episode 3: the red flags that show up early, and that most clients ignore because the sales process felt smooth.\nRed flag: the proposal has no specific mention of YOUR business, could be sent to anyone.\nRed flag: they avoid naming who exactly will do the work.\nGreen flag by contrast: they ask harder diagnostic questions in the sales call than you expected -- that's a sign of real practitioners, not salespeople.\nRed flag: the success metric is left deliberately vague, so it can never technically fail.\nComment \"REDFLAG\" and I'll send you the full red-flag checklist we tell prospective clients to run on US.",
