    pillar: "authority", contentType: "authority", angle: "Framework / Formula / Acronym", format: "Talking Back & Forth",
    funnelStage: "bofu", ctaType: B, conceptBucket: "proven", effort: "high", seriesName: "Consulting Insider",
    bodyBlack: "Episode 4, the finale: assuming you've already hired someone, here's how to actually get your money's worth out of them.\nGive them real access to the messy internal reality, not the polished version -- consultants solve the problem you show them, not the one you have.\nHold one specific outcome review per month, tied to the number from the proposal, not a vague check-in.\nBe the client who asks harder questions, not fewer -- the engagements that actually work are the ones where the client stayed genuinely involved.\nThat's the series -- 4 episodes on how this industry actually works from the inside.\nComment \"INSIDER\" and I'll DM you the full client playbook built from all 4 episodes.",
