    bodyBlack: "Level 1: a tagline that sounds nice but tells no one what you actually do.\nLevel 2: a clear description of what you do.\nLevel 3: a clear description of the specific outcome you deliver, for a specific person, that they'd repeat back to a friend.\nMost businesses get stuck at Level 2 and wonder why referrals don't happen.",
