    funnelStage: "tofu", ctaType: T, conceptBucket: "proven", effort: "default",
    bodyBlack: "One line: \"I help [specific person] get [specific outcome] without [the thing they hate most about the alternative].\"\nSpecific person, not \"businesses.\" Specific outcome, not \"growth.\" A named pain point of the alternative, not a vague benefit.\nMost value props fail on the first blank -- \"businesses\" describes everyone, which is the same as describing no one.\nRewrite yours with all 3 blanks this specific, and watch how much sharper it reads.",
