    bodyBlack: "Dumb marketer: measures awareness by impressions.\nSmart marketer: measures awareness by how many prospects mention you unprompted in a sales conversation.\nDumb marketer: can't tell if the budget is working for 6 months. Smart marketer: has a weekly proxy signal from day one.\nComment \"AWARENESS\" and I'll DM you the exact proxy signal I track weekly.",
